		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="1410" y="223" width="439" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">戍卫凝成霜锤，进行2次的挥动攻击，依次造成<span color="#99ffff">60%,70%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="511" width="408" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">戍卫凝成霜锤，将其击地，扬起雪尘，来回两次，均造成<span color="#99ffff">60%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="799" width="442" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">戍卫在低于<span color="#ffdfbf">50%生命值</span><span>时，会将自己封入「</span><span textDecoration="underline">冰棺</span><span>」，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">16s</span><span>后解除，并恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50%生命值</span><span>，仅触发一次。</span><span color="#ffbfff">[绝境]</span><span>冰棺解除后造成</span><span color="#99ffff">80%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="899" y="62" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#2686a2" width="207" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#2686a2">制图@Csxylic米游社</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="223" width="424" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">戍卫使用右手进行拳击，造成<span color="#99ffff">50%</span><span>伤害，接着短暂蓄力后发出强力拳，造成</span><span color="#99ffff">80%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="511" width="437" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较远时，戍卫结出3枚寒晶，迸射而来，造成<span color="#99ffff">80%,8%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="799" width="408" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较远时，戍卫就着霜锤飞跃而来，重重落地造成<span color="#99ffff">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/凝冰戍卫tps.assets/Image_16.png')" x="720" y="137">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/凝冰戍卫tps.assets/Image_17.png')" x="720" y="425">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/凝冰戍卫tps.assets/Image_18.png')" x="719" y="714">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="66" y="912" width="436" height="39" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">冰棺：<span color="#99ffff">16冻</span><span>盾，可伤害转化，击破会直接击败戍卫。</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>会使</span><span color="#ffacff">雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fffd7">风</span><span>的相应反应消耗比变为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">1:4</span><span>，而</span><span color="#ff9999">火</span><span>融化变为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">1:1</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
